{"study_accession":"PRJNA1129180","secondary_study_accession":"SRP516609","title":"Transcriptomic profile of human Mesenchymal Stem Cells cryopreserved in a DMSO-free solution","description":"An essential aspect of ensuring availability and stability of mesenchymal stem/stromal cells (MSCs) products for clinical use is that these cells are cryopreserved before individual infusion into patients. Currently, cryopreservation of MSCs involves use of a cryoprotectant solution containing dimethyl sulfoxide (DMSO). However, it is recognized that DMSO may be toxic for both the patient and the MSC product. In this Production Assistance for Cellular Therapies (PACT) and Biomedical Excellence for Safer Transfusion (BEST) Collaborative study, we compared a novel DMSO-free solution with DMSO containing cryoprotectant solutions for freezing MSCs.","pubmed":"","geo_series":"","n_samples":40,"study_labels":[],"samples":[{"sample_accession":"SAMN42147078","study_accession":"PRJNA1129180","blood_class":"bone_marrow","class_from":"sample","title":"21-1001002-R7788-115-TEST-Center#1","description":"21-1001002-R7788-115-TEST-Center#1","sex":"not applicable","geo_sample":"","access":"open","dbgap":"","n_runs":1,"first_public":"2024-06-30","attributes":[["isolate","21-1001002-R7788-115-TEST-Center#1"],["age","not applicable"],["biomaterial_provider","21-1001002-R7788-115-TEST-Center#1"],["collection_date","not provided"],["geo_loc_name","not applicable"],["sex","not applicable"],["tissue","bone marrow"]],"runs":[{"run_accession":"SRR29631034","experiment_accession":"SRX25137086","library_layout":"PAIRED","library_selection":"cDNA_randomPriming","instrument_model":"NextSeq 550","read_count":19139996,"base_count":2889916583,"first_public":"2024-06-30","experiment_title":"NextSeq 550 sequencing: 21-1001002-R7788-115-TEST-Center#1"}],"labels":[],"single_cell":false},{"sample_accession":"SAMN42147079","study_accession":"PRJNA1129180","blood_class":"bone_marrow","class_from":"sample","title":"2